{
    "title": "Farm Land - Farming life game",
    "description": "<h1>Can you build and manage an entire big farm? Are you ready for country life? </h1>\r\n\r\n<h2>Your quest is simple...seed the fields, harvest them, raise your animal farm, and expand your island to become one of the best farmer boys in one of the best idle farming games\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWelcome to your new free game: Farm Land! Go on adventures, raise animals and expand your Island and golden farm in this fun Farming Simulator!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf4e Harvest apples, wheat, tomatoes, eggplants, and all your favorite fruits and vegetables\r\n\ud83d\udc36 Raise a wide variety of adorable pets in your animal farm\r\n\ud83d\udc2e Milk the cow, sheep, and hens to get milk and eggs\r\n\ud83d\ude9c Explore a fantastic big farm island filled with special farm adventures and harvesting fun!\r\n\ud83d\udc20 Catch as many fishes as you can on the coast or in the river\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Sell your crops, goods, daily harvest and resources to other farmer boys \r\n\r\nCome and relax in this free chill and idle farming game, grow your fields, milk the cow, do the daily harvest, take care of your animals in your animal farm, hire workers and build bigger barns. Take part in many satisfying activities: plant watering, cow milking, tree shaking, sheep shearing, and much more. When harvest season comes, sell your products to the merchants in town and become the greatest farming tycoon on earth, the moon, and beyond with your golden farm.\r\n\r\nPlay for free. Challenge yourself to become one of the best farmer boys around in your golden farm...\r\nThis is not one of those classic and boring farming games or farming simulator. This is a new, free, and cool farming simulator for farmer boys and girls that want to explore the big farm life and enjoy harvesting .\r\n\r\n<b>List of the features of your new free casual game:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Beautiful 3D graphics\r\n\ud83d\ude9c The funniest farming simulator, daily harvest, milk the cow and more fun\r\n\ud83c\udf31 100% free game\r\n\ud83d\ude9c Fun and addictive gameplay in your big farm\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Easy controls\r\n\ud83d\ude9c One of the best idle farming games\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Game for girls and boys\r\n\ud83d\ude9c Many fruits, cute and wild animals in your animal farm, tractors for harvesting and objects to discover\r\n\r\n<b>How to become a Farm Land master?</b>\r\n\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Love your fields and take care of them\r\n\u270c\ufe0f Seed and harvest them\r\n\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Raise your pigs, cows, chickens, and pets \r\n\u270c\ufe0f Fish in the river & daily harvest\r\n\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Sell your products, and buy new land in one of the best idle farming games\r\n\u270c\ufe0f Explore and expand your domain to build the biggest farm ever\r\n\r\n<b>About Homa:</b>\r\nFarm Land is produced by Homa Games. Homa is a top publisher of Hyper Casual Games, Puzzle Games, and Casual Games. Homa published games like Sky Roller, Z Escape, Voodoo Pranks, NERF Epic Pranks!, and many others.\r\n\r\nRelieve stress, anger, and bad thoughts, or train your brain with a relaxing, satisfying, yet challenging game anywhere, anytime!\r\n\r\nIf you believe that building a farming empire is not just a matter of luck, show your abilities and become the best farmer ever in your golden farm. Best of luck!\r\n\r\n<b>Do you have questions regarding our game or need support?</b>\r\n\ud83d\ude0e <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homagames.com%2Fprivacy&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0_tNddT5TyBlKC1iCas6Fn\">Privacy Policy</a>\r\n\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08 <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homagames.com%2Fterms&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw1dnCgTTu_bGLcYFufdw22O\">Terms of Service</a>\r\n\ud83d\udc8c <a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fcontact%40homagames.com&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw2K2rUnrbV-6Pi6ZlrqKYaz\">Contact Us</a>\r\n\r\n<b>Follow us on our social:</b>\r\n\ud83e\udd1f <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhomagames&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0Xrb3aCs55uhevg_W6nNV3\">Facebook</a>\r\n\ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udffd <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhomagames&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw3ibsWoJZDMLy5AVqWIibMP\">Twitter</a>\r\n\ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udffc <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fhoma-games%2Fmycompany%2F&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw0sMYSLM9IphvHIfVYLjs3e\">Linkedin</a>\r\n\ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udfff <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40homagames%3Flang%3Den&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw19kHbCL7hrSLQma_TMfPJj\">Tiktok</a>\r\n</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1>Can you build and manage an entire big farm? Are you ready for country life? </h1><br><br><h2>Your quest is simple...seed the fields, harvest them, raise your animal farm, and expand your island to become one of the best farmer boys in one of the best idle farming games<br></h2><br><br><p><br>Welcome to your new free game: Farm Land! Go on adventures, raise animals and expand your Island and golden farm in this fun Farming Simulator!<br><br>\ud83c\udf4e Harvest apples, wheat, tomatoes, eggplants, and all your favorite fruits and vegetables<br>\ud83d\udc36 Raise a wide variety of adorable pets in your animal farm<br>\ud83d\udc2e Milk the cow, sheep, and hens to get milk and eggs<br>\ud83d\ude9c Explore a fantastic big farm island filled with special farm adventures and harvesting fun!<br>\ud83d\udc20 Catch as many fishes as you can on the coast or in the river<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Sell your crops, goods, daily harvest and resources to other farmer boys <br><br>Come and relax in this free chill and idle farming game, grow your fields, milk the cow, do the daily harvest, take care of your animals in your animal farm, hire workers and build bigger barns. Take part in many satisfying activities: plant watering, cow milking, tree shaking, sheep shearing, and much more. When harvest season comes, sell your products to the merchants in town and become the greatest farming tycoon on earth, the moon, and beyond with your golden farm.<br><br>Play for free. Challenge yourself to become one of the best farmer boys around in your golden farm...<br>This is not one of those classic and boring farming games or farming simulator. This is a new, free, and cool farming simulator for farmer boys and girls that want to explore the big farm life and enjoy harvesting .<br><br><b>List of the features of your new free casual game:</b><br>\ud83c\udf31 Beautiful 3D graphics<br>\ud83d\ude9c The funniest farming simulator, daily harvest, milk the cow and more fun<br>\ud83c\udf31 100% free game<br>\ud83d\ude9c Fun and addictive gameplay in your big farm<br>\ud83c\udf31 Easy controls<br>\ud83d\ude9c One of the best idle farming games<br>\ud83c\udf31 Game for girls and boys<br>\ud83d\ude9c Many fruits, cute and wild animals in your animal farm, tractors for harvesting and objects to discover<br><br><b>How to become a Farm Land master?</b><br>\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Love your fields and take care of them<br>\u270c\ufe0f Seed and harvest them<br>\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Raise your pigs, cows, chickens, and pets <br>\u270c\ufe0f Fish in the river &amp; daily harvest<br>\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Sell your products, and buy new land in one of the best idle farming games<br>\u270c\ufe0f Explore and expand your domain to build the biggest farm ever<br><br><b>About Homa:</b><br>Farm Land is produced by Homa Games. Homa is a top publisher of Hyper Casual Games, Puzzle Games, and Casual Games. Homa published games like Sky Roller, Z Escape, Voodoo Pranks, NERF Epic Pranks!, and many others.<br><br>Relieve stress, anger, and bad thoughts, or train your brain with a relaxing, satisfying, yet challenging game anywhere, anytime!<br><br>If you believe that building a farming empire is not just a matter of luck, show your abilities and become the best farmer ever in your golden farm. Best of luck!<br><br><b>Do you have questions regarding our game or need support?</b><br>\ud83d\ude0e <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homagames.com%2Fprivacy&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_tNddT5TyBlKC1iCas6Fn\">Privacy Policy</a><br>\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08 <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homagames.com%2Fterms&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw1dnCgTTu_bGLcYFufdw22O\">Terms of Service</a><br>\ud83d\udc8c <a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fcontact%40homagames.com&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw2K2rUnrbV-6Pi6ZlrqKYaz\">Contact Us</a><br><br><b>Follow us on our social:</b><br>\ud83e\udd1f <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhomagames&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Xrb3aCs55uhevg_W6nNV3\">Facebook</a><br>\ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udffd <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhomagames&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ibsWoJZDMLy5AVqWIibMP\">Twitter</a><br>\ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udffc <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fhoma-games%2Fmycompany%2F&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw0sMYSLM9IphvHIfVYLjs3e\">Linkedin</a><br>\ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udfff <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40homagames%3Flang%3Den&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw19kHbCL7hrSLQma_TMfPJj\">Tiktok</a><br></p>",
